images.caption:
Bright green grass at Lost Spring Site
Rolling green grass; Lost Spring is 2.3 miles west of Lost Springs, KS on the north side of a paved road. The spring was a valuable source of water, and was also used as a trading ranch, stage station, and campground. The spring still flows and wagon ruts are visible nearby;
